> Alpha164:533mhz(-O4)       46 min. 38 sec.
> Alpha164:533mhz (-O5)      39 min. 03 sec.
> Alpha 264 500 mhz               23 min. 40 sec.
> 

The obvious thing to do is first profile the code and see
what's eating up the time. Compile with '-pg' and see what's
going on. You might be surprised. Also, there usually are
new compilers with new HW releases.


