MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: TEXT/PLAIN; charset=US-ASCII


Hello,

Does anyone have a good Check book app for AlphaLinux? The closest I could
get to Quicken is GNUcash (www.gnucash.org) which is in early development
and it is the results of merging xacc (X Accountant) and some other apps
to make one common project. But there are no binaries of xacc for our
favorite platform... Sooo does someone have a nice Quicken like app native
for AlphaLinux or compiled binaries of xacc?? It (xacc) uses motif but
will compile with some versions of lesstif according to the web site. But
I have a slow net connection and would rather not have to download it. If
someone wouldn't mind taking a few minutes to visit the web site and grab
the source and build it, that would be great!


TIA,

Ron


